<title>USA: NYSE July short interest falls by 49.1 mln shares.</title>
<headline>NYSE July short interest falls by 49.1 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said on Monday that short interest in the month ended July 15 fell by 49.1 million shares to 3.39 billion shares.</p>
<p>The exchange said that short interest in the previous month, which ended June 13, totaled 3.44 billion shares.</p>
<p>((New York newsdesk 212-859-1730))</p>
